# Restart A/B instances

When both A and B stacks should stay running, restart with:

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -File scripts\start-gardend.ps1 -Instance all
```

Do **not** restart A then B (or B then A) separately. Single-instance restart can stop the other instance's backend (shared repo process cleanup), leaving only one stack up.

- A only: `-Instance a` (api `:50051`, web `:3000`)
- B only: `-Instance b` (api `:50052`, web `:3001`)
- Both: `-Instance all`
